<LegalLayout locale="en" title="Privacy policy | Yercaud Lake" description="Privacy policy" noindex><h1 class="section-title">Privacy policy</h1><p>Updated 25 October 2026</p><h2>About this website</h2><p>This independent visitor guide is not the boat-house operator, TTDC or a government website. It has no account registration, payment, ticket-booking or project contact form. External services have their own policies.</p><h2>Analytics and choices</h2><p>Google Analytics G-HXM22WWPKP is off until a choice allowing it is saved and verified. A successful allowance may load the script immediately. Withdrawal turns measurement off on this page immediately and attempts to save refusal and clear accessible GA cookies; it cannot recall earlier requests. If storage fails, the message explains whether shared refusal was confirmed and whether an older choice may affect a future page or session.</p><h2>Preferences and weather storage</h2><p>The optional preferences flag records your selection; it does not automatically restore a theme or choose a language. The URL determines the language. Weather uses fixed lake coordinates, not your device location. The native endpoint requests Open-Meteo model data and may cache validated data for ten minutes. The browser may save a recent validated forecast for up to ten minutes; a dated build snapshot or saved forecast is labelled with its provider time.</p><h2>Maps and offline pages</h2><p>The Google map connects to Google when loaded and the provider receives normal connection data under its own policy. GA settings do not control that map. The service worker can cache this site’s resources and previously visited pages for offline use; it excludes the weather API. Offline pages may be older. A page without its own cached copy is unavailable rather than replaced with the home page.</p><h2>Hosting performance measurement</h2><p>Cloudflare hosting may process connection data and inject a performance or RUM beacon separately from Google Analytics. This site’s GA choice does not control that hosting beacon. A script’s presence does not prove that a particular visit transmitted telemetry. Consult Cloudflare’s documentation for its service.</p><h2>Managing data</h2><p>Use Cookie settings to change analytics permission. Browser settings can clear this site’s cookies, storage and offline cache, including saved choices. Consult external providers’ policies when following their links.</p><p><a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/data-metrics/data-origin-and-collection/">Cloudflare — data origin and collection</a> · <a href="https://open-meteo.com/en/terms">Open-Meteo</a> · <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google</a></p><p><a href="/en/cookies/">Cookie settings</a> · <a href="/CREDITS.txt">Photograph credits</a></p></LegalLayout>
